```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as REST API
    participant KCC as KafkaCruiseControl
    participant LM as LoadMonitor
    participant GO as GoalOptimizer
    participant EX as Executor
    participant Kafka as Kafka Cluster

    Note over Kafka: Continuous Background Process
    loop Every 120 seconds
        Kafka->>Kafka: MetricsReporter collects JMX metrics
        Kafka->>Kafka: Produce to __CruiseControlMetrics
    end

    Note over LM: Continuous Background Process
    loop Every 120 seconds
        LM->>Kafka: Consume metrics from topic
        LM->>LM: Aggregate into time windows
        LM->>LM: Update ClusterModel
    end

    Note over User,Kafka: User-Initiated Rebalance
    User->>API: POST /rebalance?goals=...
    API->>KCC: rebalance(goals, options)

    KCC->>KCC: Check no execution in progress
    KCC->>KCC: Set state: GENERATING_PROPOSALS

    KCC->>LM: clusterModel(allowEstimation=true)
    LM->>LM: Build/retrieve current ClusterModel
    LM-->>KCC: ClusterModel

    KCC->>GO: optimizations(model, goals, options)

    loop For each goal in priority order
        GO->>GO: goal.optimize(clusterModel)
        Note over GO: Modifies ClusterModel in-place
    end

    GO->>GO: Diff initial vs final ClusterModel
    GO-->>KCC: OptimizerResult with ExecutionProposals

    KCC->>EX: executeProposals(proposals, model)
    EX->>EX: Set state: STARTING_EXECUTION

    Note over EX,Kafka: Phase 1: Inter-Broker Movements
    EX->>EX: Create ExecutionTasks (PENDING)
    EX->>Kafka: AdminClient.alterPartitionReassignments()

    loop Monitor execution (every 10s)
        EX->>Kafka: Check ISR status
        Kafka-->>EX: Replica in-sync status
        EX->>EX: Update task state (IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED)
    end

    Note over EX,Kafka: Phase 2: Leadership Movements
    EX->>Kafka: AdminClient.electLeaders()
    Kafka-->>EX: Leadership changed

    EX->>EX: Set state: NO_TASK_IN_PROGRESS
    EX-->>KCC: Execution complete

    KCC-->>API: OptimizerResult
    API-->>User: 200 OK with UserTaskId

    Note over User,API: User polls for completion
    loop Every 5 seconds
        User->>API: GET /user_tasks?user_task_ids=...
        API-->>User: Status: IN_PROGRESS / COMPLETED
    end
```
